  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Wednesday 25 November 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTucked away in a peaceful and convenient Browns Bay location, this inviting family home offers the perfect blend of space, comfort and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFeaturing four well-proportioned bedrooms, a separate living area and generous family spaces, there's plenty of room for everyone to enjoy their own space while coming together as a family.\r\n\r\nStep outside and discover a beautiful, lush green garden, a private and peaceful sanctuary surrounded by greenery. Whether it's enjoying your morning coffee, entertaining friends or simply unwinding after a busy day, this garden offers a wonderful sense of privacy and tranquility.\r\n\r\nA charming detached sleepout adds another special touch, ideal as a home office, study or creative retreat. \r\n\r\nDownstairs concrete block and upstairs weatherboard cladding offers a solid, strong, low-maintenance, and quiet living environment. \r\n\r\nConveniently positioned close to local shops, schools, parks and the beautiful East Coast Bays coastline, this home brings together everyday convenience and relaxed family living.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n• Four well-proportioned bedrooms\r\n• Separate living area\r\n• Beautiful, private and established green garden\r\n• Detached sleepout – ideal for a home office or study\r\n• Generous family living spaces\r\n• Approximately 466sqm freehold land\r\n• Approximately 247sqm floor area \r\n• Recently renovated and ready to move in\r\n\r\nMore Than Just a Home – Your Own Private Retreat,\r\n\r\nProperties like this don't come onto the market often, so be quick!\r\n\r\nContact us for more information, or book your private viewing.",
